WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
You are what you did for me. You have heard my prayers. You have seen my suffering. You have felt my pain.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:17.000
You have helped me so much. Thank you so much. I will never forget whatever you did for me. I will be always grateful to you, Father.

3
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:28.000
I touch your feet and thank you heartedly for getting my husband back to me, for removing all my pain, my suffering, for getting the father of my son back to him.

4
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Thank you so much. I will always be grateful to you. I will always be close to you, Father. Thank you so much. I love you. Thank you for helping me.

5
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:44.000
I will never forget. You are God for me. You are my Savior, my angel, my God, Father. Thank you very, very much.
